$( <MM> <PROOF_ASST> THEOREM=carmtmw  LOC_AFTER=?

* The main theorem of carmichael.tex in the machine model, conditional on the AGP 3.1 pigeonhole statement (the hypotheses of ~ carmsw ): a TM2 machine computes, from n, a Carmichael number in ( n , n ^ ( 1 + e ) ] with its prime factorization, in time exp ( c log n log log n ) (milestone M-W).

